":"徙倚溪亭惜坠芳，恨无异域返魂香。\n残枝并恐风吹去，插在金瓶置坐傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29587,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"刘园水竹绝幽清，花径繁红藓砌青。\n何处贵游开步障，谁家生色画深屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29588,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"凤州宫柳昔曾攀，亦醉琼花芍药间。\n独有海棠心未足，每逢多处必来看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29589,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"千株绛雪照沧湾，应笑刘郎带老颜。\n尚有少年情味在，戏搜绮语续花间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29590,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"蔷薇难比况金沙，一种风标富贵家。\n我有公评君记取，惜花须惜海棠花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29591,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"色深乍捣守宫红，片细俄随蛱蝶风。\n到得离披无意绪，精神全在半开中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29592,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游栖霞洞","author":"刘克庄","text":"直路幽阴侧路明，玉为墙壁雪为城。\n殷勤报有诗翁到，万一仙人肯出迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29593,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赠钱道人二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"寻师入蜀未曾逢，要看罗浮晓日红。\n若见仙人知去处，却来相引到山中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29594,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赠钱道人二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"拙貌惭君子细看，镜中我自觉神寒。\n直从杜甫编排起，几个吟人作大官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29595,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘仙岩","author":"刘克庄","text":"绝顶来寻鍊药踪，老仙端的是吾宗。\n寄声月白风清夜，定许相期第几峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29596,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华严寺逢旧苍头","author":"刘克庄","text":"曾向丛林寄幅巾，十年尘涴卧云身。\n侍琴童子长于竹，去礼山僧作主人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29597,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同安","author":"刘克庄","text":"城不能高甫及肩，临风搔首一怀贤。\n当时矮屋今存否，曾著文公住四年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29598,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其十","author":"刘克庄","text":"老奴昔逐我西东，捷似猿猱跳绝峰。\n今日道旁扶一拐，汝公安得不龙钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29599,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其九","author":"刘克庄","text":"北耗而今杳不知，路傍羽檄走无时。\n自怜满镜星星发，羞见官中募士旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29600,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"铁马防秋记昔曾，晚涂消缩似寒蝇。\n同时校尉俱封拜，谁伴将军猎霸陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29601,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"古于生死验交情，何况台攲沼渐平。\n不是刘君同郑老，苔深草合断人行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29602,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"蔂梩而掩古无讥，何必封崇揭祸机。\n到得珠襦金椀出，始知裸葬不为非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29603,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]